  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      110.04,
      517.88,
      544.1,
      536.16
    ],
    "text": "The accused appellant in this case was convicted for aiding and abetting",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.73,
      541.88,
      544.1,
      560.16
    ],
    "text": "four persons unknown to the prosecution to commit the murder of a man named",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.346925735473633
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.34,
      566.12,
      543.52,
      584.39
    ],
    "text": "Kandasamy Vasanthan. He was shot dead by some people unknown to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.67,
      590.35,
      544.6,
      608.63
    ],
    "text": "prosecution. The accused appellant after trial was sentenced to death. Being",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.49,
      614.59,
      543.26,
      632.87
    ],
    "text": "aggrieved by the said conviction and the sentence she has appealed to this court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.07,
      638.83,
      390.83,
      657.12
    ],
    "text": "Facts of this case may be briefly summarized as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.21342945098877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.61,
      662.6,
      543.92,
      680.88
    ],
    "text": "Vijaya and her husband Rasathurai were running a video shop in the police",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      68.5,
      686.84,
      543.49,
      705.12
    ],
    "text": "area of Eravur. The deceased person Vasanthan was working as an assistant in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.699999809265137,
      14.346925735473633
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      303.53,
      32.67,
      312.23,
      48.14
    ],
    "text": "2",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.6,
      68.26,
      544.74,
      86.67
    ],
    "text": "shop. He used to sleep in the house Vijaya. Rasathurai was a member of L TTE.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.28,
      92.5,
      545.12,
      110.91
    ],
    "text": "Vijaya, in her evidence, admits that at the time of the incident in this case two",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.18,
      116.75,
      545.06,
      135.15
    ],
    "text": "armed groups known as Prabakaran's group and Karuna's group were operating.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.18,
      141.7,
      545.0,
      160.11
    ],
    "text": "On 24.10.2004 around 8.00 p.m. while Vijaya, her children and Vasanthan were",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.34,
      165.95,
      545.63,
      184.35
    ],
    "text": "sleeping in her house, she heard the accused appellant who was living in her",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.05,
      190.18,
      548.18,
      208.6
    ],
    "text": "neighbourhood calling her. When she opened the door of the house and the gate of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.8,
      214.67,
      545.42,
      233.08
    ],
    "text": "the garden, she saw the accused appellant standing near the gate. When the accused",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.17,
      238.92,
      545.67,
      257.32
    ],
    "text": "appellant made inquiries about Vijaya's husband, she informed her that husband",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.05,
      263.16,
      545.41,
      281.57
    ],
    "text": "was not at home as he had gone out in the evening. The accused appellant then",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.06,
      287.88,
      545.02,
      306.29
    ],
    "text": "requested her to give video deck and the cassette. At this time Vijaya says that she",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.8,
      312.11,
      544.67,
      330.53
    ],
    "text": "heard a sound of firing. Vasanthan fell on the ground as he sustained injuries from",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.58,
      336.58,
      545.35,
      354.99
    ],
    "text": "the firing. Then she saw four people whom she could not identify as they had",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.96,
      360.82,
      544.78,
      379.23
    ],
    "text": "covered their face. At this time the accused appellant used the following language.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.62,
      385.3,
      545.28,
      403.71
    ],
    "text": "\"Do not let her go. Shoot her too.\" The accused appellant had also told the gunmen",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.56,
      409.55,
      398.14,
      427.95
    ],
    "text": "to leave the place. Vasanthan died due to gunshot injures.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      434.26,
      544.42,
      452.67
    ],
    "text": "The dock statement of the accused appellant may be briefly summarized as",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.770719528198242,
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.69,
      458.75,
      545.17,
      477.16
    ],
    "text": "follows. While she was sleeping in the night, some people came and told her that",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.3,
      482.98,
      544.94,
      501.39
    ],
    "text": "Periyavaran was expecting her. She then went with them. On the way, they",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.49,
      507.23,
      544.96,
      525.63
    ],
    "text": "instructed her to knock on the door and call Vijaya which she did. Thereafter she",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.38,
      531.47,
      489.3,
      549.88
    ],
    "text": "heard the sound of gun fire. This was the summary of her dock statement.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      114.3,
      555.7,
      544.95,
      574.18
    ],
    "text": "It is necessary to consider whether the evidence of Vijaya that the accused",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.209590911865234,
      14.265209197998047
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.22,
      580.18,
      544.67,
      598.59
    ],
    "text": "appellant told the four persons to shoot her (Vijaya) too and asking them to leave",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      68.85,
      604.18,
      545.23,
      622.59
    ],
    "text": "the place is acceptable or not. If this evidence is true, it means that the accused",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.250448226928711
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      68.98,
      628.43,
      544.44,
      646.83
    ],
    "text": "appellant had discussed the shooting incident with the four persons prior to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.26,
      652.42,
      545.11,
      670.83
    ],
    "text": "incident. If that is so the accused appellant could have, prior to the shooting",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.250448226928711
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      68.99,
      676.42,
      544.43,
      694.83
    ],
    "text": "incident, told the four persons to eliminate Vijaya too. There was no necessity for",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      68.82,
      700.43,
      544.45,
      718.84
    ],
    "text": "her to tell these words to be heard by the others. When I consider all these matters,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      304.43,
      33.29,
      312.68,
      47.96
    ],
    "text": "3",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.0,
      68.5,
      545.88,
      86.91
    ],
    "text": "the evidence of Vijaya regarding the words used by the accused appellant does not",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.34,
      92.98,
      545.5,
      111.39
    ],
    "text": "satisfy the test of probability. I therefore hold that it is dangerous to act on the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.533221244812012,
      13.800000190734863,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.9,
      117.23,
      521.7,
      135.63
    ],
    "text": "above evidence ofVijaya. Learned trial judge has not considered these matters.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      116.34,
      141.72,
      545.57,
      160.13
    ],
    "text": "Was there a conspiracy between the accused appellant and the four persons",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.79,
      165.95,
      545.86,
      184.38
    ],
    "text": "who shot the deceased? If there was such a conspiracy would she have continued",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.41523551940918
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.77,
      190.18,
      546.04,
      208.59
    ],
    "text": "to stand near the gate of Vijaya to be seen by the inmates of the house? She could",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047,
      14.399191856384277
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      71.02,
      214.66,
      545.11,
      233.07
    ],
    "text": "have called Vijaya and easily disappeared from the place. When I consider all",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.77,
      239.39,
      545.22,
      257.8
    ],
    "text": "these matters, it is not possible to conclude that she had conspired with the four",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.730775833129883,
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.83,
      263.39,
      249.83,
      281.8
    ],
    "text": "persons who shot the deceased.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      112.3,
      287.85,
      545.21,
      306.26
    ],
    "text": "According to her dock statement she went and called Vijaya and this was",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.94,
      312.1,
      545.31,
      330.51
    ],
    "text": "done on the instructions of four unknown persons. Is there any reason to reject this",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863,
      14.265209197998047
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.77,
      336.58,
      545.85,
      354.99
    ],
    "text": "version? I think not. The learned trial judge rejected the dock statement but did not",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      70.43,
